        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Anxiety course and reported triggers"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Symptoms present for more than 12 months and worse over the last 6–8 months. Further worsening over approximately the last 2 months with partner's increased office attendance, now 3 days per week. Increased coffee on those mornings feels like it worsens anxiety. Heavy news and phone use reportedly increases jitteriness."
      }
    },
    {
